Package: mantra-iris-service
Version: 1.0.0
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: default-jre | openjdk-11-jre | openjdk-17-jre
Maintainer: Verification Portal <ops@example.com>
Description: Localhost iris SDK service for the Verification Portal
 Wraps Mantra's Marvis_Auth.jar (MIS100V2 iris scanner) behind a JSON
 HTTP API on localhost:8031, parallel to morfinauth-client-service on
 :8030. Runs as a systemd unit started at boot. Used by the operator's
 browser to capture and 1:1-match iris images during candidate
 verification.
